{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s01", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "第六天清点时，学习者报告透明盘A的十粒绿豆中有七粒露出白根。记录只到白根出现，没有测量根长，也没有追踪这些种子后来是否成活。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s02", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "At the day-six check, the learner counted four seeds with visible roots in covered tray B, out of ten seeds. Tray B received 5 mL of water each day, while tray A received 10 mL. The learner did not repeat this comparison.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "condition_limit", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s03", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "两盘都放在同一间教室，但A盘靠窗，B盘放在柜内。没有记录各自温度，浇水量也不同，因此这份观察不能把发芽差异单独归因于光照。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": false, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "unaccepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s04", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "A possible next test would give both trays the same amount of water and change only their exposure to light. The learner has not agreed to this proposal, no new seeds have been planted, and there are no results from that test.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s05", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "hinted", "text": "老师先提醒“除了遮光，还改了什么”，学习者随后才指出两盘每天的水量不同。这是提示后的具体回答，不能据此说学习者已经能独立识别所有实验中的混杂条件。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s06", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "independent", "text": "Before any hint in a separate seed-counting task, the learner said each tray should begin with the same number of seeds. That answer concerned the starting count only; it did not identify unequal water amounts in the earlier comparison.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": true, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "accepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s07", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "学习者同意下次每天用同一量筒给两盘各加八毫升水，再记录白根出现的数量。这是已接受但尚未执行的计划；今天没有因此增加任何新的发芽观察。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "temporary_request", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s08", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "For this seed activity, the learner asked to look at a picture of a root before reading the explanation. This was a request for the present session; no preference for pictures in all future lessons was stated.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "explicit_correction", "event_kind": "correction", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s09", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "更正：第六天A盘露出白根的是七粒，不是先前口头说的八粒，盘内总数仍为十粒。改正的是计数，尚未补测根长，也没有新增一次独立试验。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "stated_goal", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "germination_s10", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "germination", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_germination", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "The learner wants to work out whether darkness changes how many seeds show roots when the watering conditions are controlled. This is an expressed learning goal, not a completed controlled test or evidence that the learner has mastered plant growth.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s01", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "在十二厘米跨度上，学习者报告折成手风琴形的桥C托住了六枚垫圈，第七枚放上后桥面触到桌面。只做了一次，没有称每枚垫圈的质量。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s02", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "Flat bridge D reached the table when the third washer was placed, so it had held two washers beforehand. Its gap was 15 cm. The learner used the same sheet size as bridge C but did not keep the span the same.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "condition_limit", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s03", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "C桥和D桥纸张尺寸相同，却分别跨十二和十五厘米，折法与跨度同时变了。没有额外对照，因此目前不能把承重差异全部算作折叠形状的效果。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": false, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "unaccepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s04", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "Someone proposed trying three different paper thicknesses while holding the fold shape and gap constant. The learner has not chosen this proposal, and no thickness comparison has been built or tested. It supplies no load measurements.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s05", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "hinted", "text": "老师用手指出两座桥下的空隙不一样后，学习者才说跨度也应相同。这句话有明确视觉提示，不能把它记录成无提示完成公平比较设计。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s06", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "independent", "text": "Before a hint during preparation, the learner suggested adding washers one at a time instead of dropping several together. This independently stated procedure controls how the load is added; it does not show that the learner noticed the unequal gaps.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": true, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "accepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s07", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "学习者接受下一轮把两座桥跨度都设为十厘米、每次只加一枚垫圈的安排。纸桥还没重新搭好，这一轮尚未进行，也没有十厘米跨度下的承重数字。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "temporary_request", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s08", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "During this bridge session the learner asked to handle the folded paper before hearing the explanation. The request concerned this model now; the learner did not ask to use hands-on materials before every subject in the future.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "explicit_correction", "event_kind": "correction", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s09", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "更正C桥记录：成功托住的是六枚垫圈，不是七枚；第七枚对应触桌失败，跨度仍是十二厘米。不能把失败时放上的数量当成成功承载数量。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "stated_goal", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "paper_bridge_s10", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "paper_bridge", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_paper_bridge", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "The learner wants to understand which part of a fold helps a paper bridge resist bending. No explanation has yet been checked against a comparison with equal spans, and this goal should not be recorded as an achieved understanding.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s01", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "学习者记录杯E用了四分之三杯酸奶和四分之一杯水，总量一杯。这里只记配料体积，没有称重，也没有评分甜度；分母相同不能据此说两种配料一样多。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s02", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "Cup F contained one half cup of yogurt and one half cup of water, making one cup in total. The yogurt was strawberry flavored, whereas cup E used plain yogurt. No sugar content was measured for either cup.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "condition_limit", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s03", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "E杯用原味酸奶，F杯用草莓味酸奶，配比和酸奶口味同时不同。即使后来有人说某杯更甜，也不能只把甜度差异归因于水的比例。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": false, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "unaccepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s04", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "There is a suggestion to double both ingredient amounts in cup E and compare the larger batch. The learner has not accepted it, no two-cup batch has been mixed, and no tasting result exists for that proposed batch.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s05", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "hinted", "text": "老师画出四个相同格子并涂满三个后，学习者才说四分之三比四分之一多。这个比较借助了图示，记录没有证明他已经能独立比较所有分母不同的分数。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s06", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "independent", "text": "Without a prompt, the learner explained that one half plus one half fills one whole cup, referring to cup F. The explanation did not address fractions with different denominators or explain how to double a recipe.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": true, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "accepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s07", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "学习者同意下一次都用同一盒原味酸奶，并在每杯总量一杯时比较两种配比。材料还没重新量取；这个已接受的安排没有产生新的口味观察。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "temporary_request", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s08", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "For the current fraction question, the learner asked to keep the measuring cup beside the written symbols. The request was about this exercise, and no lasting preference for avoiding equations or using objects in every lesson was stated.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "explicit_correction", "event_kind": "correction", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s09", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "更正E杯的记法：酸奶为四分之三杯、水为四分之一杯，总量仍是一杯；先前把两者写反了。修正的是配料对应关系，并不是重新调配了一杯。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "stated_goal", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "fractions_s10", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "fractions", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_fractions", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "The learner wants to explain why doubling both ingredients can preserve their ratio. A doubled mixture has not been prepared, and the learner has not yet given a checked explanation of this goal.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s01", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "学习者摘录故事中的一句：小岚把湿雨衣挂在门边，钟指向四点。摘录没有写她是否淋了雨，也没有写四点是上午还是下午；这里只核对了这一句。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s02", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "In a different scene, Arun put a dry umbrella under his desk at six o'clock. The learner copied that sentence accurately. The sentence did not say that he had walked home, and it did not identify morning or evening.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "condition_limit", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s03", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "雨衣是湿的可以作为一种推断线索，但故事摘句没有说明它为何湿。不能只靠这句认定小岚刚在雨里走过；别人的解释与原文直接陈述必须分开。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": false, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "unaccepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s04", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "The teacher suggested checking the next paragraph for an explicit explanation of the wet coat. The learner has not accepted or carried out this follow-up. No later paragraph has been quoted, so the proposed search supplies no new story fact.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s05", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "hinted", "text": "老师先问“哪几个字直接写了下雨”，学习者随后撤回了“原句明确说下雨”的说法。改口发生在提示之后，不代表他在第一次阅读时就独立区分了所有推断。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "task_specific_response", "event_kind": "learner_answer", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s06", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "independent", "text": "Before a hint about Arun's scene, the learner said that an umbrella being dry does not tell us why it was dry. This was an independent distinction in that scene, not evidence of explaining the wet coat in the other scene.", "version": 1}
