{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "temporary_request", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s08", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "For this passage only, the learner asked for the sentence to be read aloud once before discussing it. They did not request audio for all future passages or state a permanent difficulty with silent reading.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "explicit_correction", "event_kind": "correction", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s09", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "更正摘录中的时间：小岚那句钟指向四点，不是六点，湿雨衣仍挂在门边。六点属于另一人物的场景；两个场景都没有标明上午还是下午。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "stated_goal", "event_kind": "learner_statement", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "reading_s10", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "reading", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_reading", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "The learner wants to support an inference with words from a story while saying what remains uncertain. That goal has been stated, but no newly checked paragraph analysis shows that it has been achieved.", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "loops_s01", "language": "zh", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "loops", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_loops", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "学习者报告程序G运行三次循环体，每次把初值零的计数器加二，最后显示六。日志只保存了这一次运行，没有记录耗时，也没有证明其他初值下都正确。", "version": 1}
{"accepted": null, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "reported_observation", "event_kind": "observation", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "loops_s02", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "loops", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_loops", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "Program H started its counter at one, added two on each of three loop-body executions, and displayed seven. The learner ran it once. It was not a run with the same starting value as program G, and no timing measurement was saved.", "version": 1}
