{"accepted": false, "activity_id": "logical_cross_topic_workshop", "claim_type": "unaccepted_plan", "event_kind": "plan", "hardware_verified": false, "id": "loops_s04", "language": "en", "learner_id": "synthetic_workshop_learner", "namespace": "simulator", "pack_id": "loops", "scope": "current_activity", "session_id": "synthetic_loops", "source_type": "simulated", "status": "active", "support_level": "unknown", "text": "A proposed check would run program G with a negative starting counter and inspect every intermediate value. The learner has not accepted that check, it has not been run, and there is no trace from a negative starting value.", "version": 1}
